{"change_summary":"Confirmed the branch already contains the approved shrimp molt/mineral and reproduction-factor fixes from the prior review round, so this apply-fixes pass was validation-only and required no additional source edits. I rechecked the relevant parameter wiring and regression coverage, then reran the focused shrimp suites plus the full `tank_core`, `tank_data`, and `tank_scenarios` test surfaces; all passed on the current branch.","outstanding_risks":[],"steps":[{"description":"Inspected the current worktree and the relevant shrimp molt/mineral parameter and diagnostic paths to confirm the approved fixes were already present before making any edits.","order":1,"status":"completed"},{"description":"Reran the focused shrimp regression suites covering mineral-gated molting and reproduction-factor behavior to verify the reviewed paths still pass without further changes.","order":2,"status":"completed"},{"description":"Ran the full `tank_core` suite plus downstream `tank_data` and `tank_scenarios` tests to confirm broader stability, then recorded this stage as validation-only because no new fixes were needed.","order":3,"status":"completed"}],"validation_evidence":["`git status --short`","`rg -n \"failed_molt_accum_increase_per_failed_stage|MarginalFailure|test_soft_vs_hard_water_shrimp_survival|molt_failure_diagnostic_thresholds_are_named\" crates/tank_core crates/tank_data`","`cargo test -p tank_core --test molt_mineral_budget -- --nocapture`","`cargo test -p tank_core --test reproduction_factors -- --nocapture`","`cargo test -p tank_data`","`cargo test -p tank_scenarios`","`cargo test -p tank_core -- --nocapture`"]}